<title>HONG KONG: Jilin Chemical 1996 net down 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Jilin Chemical 1996 net down 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.09     vs 0.25</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.052    vs 0.052</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    311.80   vs 743.54</p>
<p>    Turnover		     7,676.40 vs 7,078.55</p>
<p>    Company name		 Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 8 to June 6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 30</p>
<p>NOTE - The company, a unit of the Jilin provincial government-controlled Jilin Chemical Group Corp, is China's largest producer of basic chemicals and chemical raw materials.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.052 yuan vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
